      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "三大公会与可改装钻机适配不同矿区危险",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "There are 3 unique guilds to choose from: ANVIL, WARHAMMER & PICKAXE . Pick from 6 upgradable Drill Rigs and customise with up to 30 different add-ons to match your play style and the location's hazards.",
