      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "叠放同名卡可把炮塔与建筑直接升阶",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Upgrade your kit by placing another of the same card on top of them. Level 1 Cannon + Level 1 Cannon = Level 2 Cannon, the maths checks out! With 10 Buildings & 26 turrets, there's a whole arsenal to upgrade.",
